    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a very optimistic way of looking at it. but for a business owner trying to keep the lights on right now, \"long-term efficiency\" doesn't pay the bills today. it feels like the government is just prioritizing green goals over the survival of small businesses. isn't it basically a fact that these regulations disproportionately hurt the little guys compared to the giant corporations who have entire legal teams to handle this?",
